    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>A plugin for mass mailing of emails to customers of WooCommerce shops and not only.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>envelope-go</code> directory to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Go to &#8216;Settings&#8217; -&gt; &#8216;Permalinks&#8217;. </li>\n<li>In item &#8216;Permalink structure&#8217; select &#8216;Post name&#8217; and click &#8216;Save changes&#8217;</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"what%20are%20the%20restrictions%20on%20the%20number%20of%20subscribers%20in%20the%20plugin%3F\">\nWhat are the restrictions on the number of subscribers in the plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Nothing!</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.4.3</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 12-08-2026</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed interface bugs.</li>\n<li>Improved plugin interface.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.2</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 03-08-2026</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed errors in calculating statistics.</li>\n<li>Improved plugin interface.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.1</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 03-08-2026</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved compatibility with the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 23-06-2026</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved compatibility with the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 21-05-2026</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 21-05-2026</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>First relise.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
